                "description": "Prodigy Leverset with Arched Rose, Omnia 912AR - The beauty of the arched rose and simple lever are sure to catch eyes on any door. A true classic, the Prodigy Leverset with Arched Rose is the perfect addition to traditional homes. The steeped arched rose adds an elegance to an otherwise simple lever. Made by Omnia Industries, the 912AR Leverset is available in single dummy, double dummy, passage and privacy functions. Both the single dummy and the double dummy functions feature concealed surface mounting for easy installation. The passage and privacy functions are available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and the two functions are packaged for both 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch thick doors. Available in 7 finishes.",
